      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Video players have been an absolute mess this year so far. Every time the patch notes mentions fixing something with video players, they become even more broken. VRC_SyncVideoStream in particular is incredibly broken and unreliable, causing issues like this where the videos wont play at all, or have a small amount of people that will be able to see the videos but not hear any audio.",
